{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "04e625efc9800949fff961c7bf50cd9d8e3c310e03664d99d953c40273b5bd4a", "ja": "グラビア撮影前", "zh": "写真摄影前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6000_place", "source_sha256": "327fdbae63a8ab8679c609c439b76102621dee58e49f495b29559a3115514c47", "ja": "キツネ王国", "zh": "狐狸王国", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6001_p", "source_sha256": "458d46f26fd034b975fc1ca1b9d75803c3616c3e25f2a1ccc583532ffdaac187", "ja": "（アイドルグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n朋花と、狐が近くで見られる施設にやってきた！）", "zh": "（今天是偶像写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的拍摄。和朋花一起来到了一个可以近距离观看狐狸的地方！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6002_031tom", "source_sha256": "4ec6d29e93d2160426a2eec9a9dd098bfb613dbcf8be37531ae0bf66e9a39b1b", "ja": "かわいいかわいい子狐ちゃん達～♪　さあ、私の元に\n集まってください～。一緒に写真を撮りますよ～。", "zh": "可爱的小狐狸们～♪来，到我这边集合吧～。一起拍张照片哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6003_p", "source_sha256": "c967f8b71aac0a848817b0c9a5930e5f28047078e1a1e733b739a7a896922e40", "ja": "…………。\nおかしいな。狐達が動こうとする気配がない。", "zh": "…………。\n奇怪了。狐狸们完全没有要动的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6004_031tom", "source_sha256": "c5c8c1d1159e0bed73486056268f26a30d7f62bc3c5d7febdcf1985a87865376", "ja": "う～ん……おかしいですね～。\n子豚ちゃんなら、喜んで集まってくれるのですが……。", "zh": "嗯～……真奇怪呢～。\n如果是小猪猪的话，明明会很高兴地聚过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6005_p", "source_sha256": "60f7f327aa3d9ebbb7d0a0541ed313f79ee65605d98ed87f689ccbc8a6c4bfd0", "ja": "まあ、狐と子豚ちゃん達だと違うのかもな。\nそれより、これじゃ撮影が始められないな……。", "zh": "也是，狐狸和小猪仔们可能还是不太一样吧。\n比起这个，这样下去就没法开始拍摄了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6006_031tom", "source_sha256": "82fa5a61727bcfc566833c321cf828378bed5855afcf53b24e41cdb843f4d5bf", "ja": "そんなことより、困りましたね～。\n聖母の慈愛が届かないとは思いませんでした～。", "zh": "比起那个，真是伤脑筋呢～  \n没想到圣母的慈爱竟然无法传达呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6007_031tom", "source_sha256": "ed726e1c651d922b0a62112b9d2204191ed3e2fffcf688ec08cf54db3b0f13c9", "ja": "仕方ありません……。ここにいる狐さん全員に、\n子豚ちゃんになってもらうとしましょう～。", "zh": "没办法……那就让在这里的所有小狐狸，\n都变成小猪仔吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6008_031tom", "source_sha256": "628b083e9cb35a829f72b11cfc0be749aee2331940a58af343975f9434c0c10c", "ja": "お仕事ですよ、{$P$}さん？\n聖母の愛を届ける方法を考えてくださいね～。ふふっ。", "zh": "是工作哦，{$P$}先生？\n请想想把圣母的爱传递出去的方法吧～呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6009_p", "source_sha256": "e70db87ecd3a3a56619e1dfd733d46c4b19d811258ac73f7c794a1416dd046f5", "ja": "ああ、任せてくれ。\n狐達に朋花の愛を届ける方法……それは……！", "zh": "啊，交给我吧。\n向狐狸们传达朋花的爱的办法……那就是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6010", "source_sha256": "e962f81e7b394a05260f3f2752f5cb5bf4d521e2444ebabd060cb34e1946ce4d", "ja": "本音の呼びかけ", "zh": "真心的呼唤", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6011", "source_sha256": "90f39244db677192dcb63bf5bc81201105c9b6bc2008d634851cec24143e5624", "ja": "愛の餌付け", "zh": "爱的投喂", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6012", "source_sha256": "565899dca7ab6a109c926daa8a129d2993c4241a750267cd8fd50a842c91beb0", "ja": "仲間だと思わせる", "zh": "让对方以为是同伴", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6100_p", "source_sha256": "bc909f1b935bf25eb1a6741827cb8f4263bc845c3b40ff41a778127245990337", "ja": "もっと本音で呼びかけてみよう！\n朋花の……いや、聖母の威厳を示すんだ！", "zh": "试着用更多真心去呼唤他们吧！\n展现出朋花的……不，展现出圣母的威严吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6101_031tom", "source_sha256": "130607c6aeeec10eb471f43107326f30c13c1c7a2d91f89b86e5d97ae970a983", "ja": "今のは私の本心ではなかったと？　生意気なことを\n言いますね～。いいでしょう、見ていなさい……！", "zh": "你是说，刚才那并不是我的真心话？真是敢说呢～。好吧，你就看着吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6102_031tom", "source_sha256": "0033f05b9b8687a37e0245ca1ce4b96329cbbe040a8940d28758c8f36290dd5f", "ja": "子狐ちゃん達、聞こえますか～。\n聖母に、そのかわいいお顔を撫でさせてください～！", "zh": "小狐狸们，听得见吗～？\n来让圣母抚摸一下你们可爱的小脸蛋吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6103_031tom", "source_sha256": "5770bc7f9b840ed481563eee59bbb873bca7326ab354a02fee494af448eba6b4", "ja": "あっ……！　たくさん集まってきました～。ふふっ。\n整列してください。順番に撫でてあげますからね～。", "zh": "啊……！聚过来的有好多呢～呵呵。\n请排好队，我会按顺序摸摸你们的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6200_p", "source_sha256": "30e54f837c6faf267b79a918e264234a59c8436c0c612834e466a6898e9328d1", "ja": "よくある方法だけど、油揚げを使ってみよう。\n食べ物で誘って、集まったところで愛を届けるんだ。", "zh": "虽然是常见的方法，不过试试油豆腐吧。\n用食物引诱，等它们聚过来后，再把爱传达给它们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6201_031tom", "source_sha256": "632d0f1ad1520739358b0f65d419df92b1f1796bba6ce43ef286b56461eb34c4", "ja": "普通ですけど、確実な方法かもしれませんね～。では、\n油揚げを置いて……。すぐにやってきましたね～。", "zh": "虽然普通，但也许是最稳妥的方法呢～。那么，把油豆腐放好……。它们很快就来了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6202_031tom", "source_sha256": "d185f707aaf4770a7090248d108b25db34c432a37a53f638d21b915cbdc80dd9", "ja": "あら～？　なんだか様子がおかしいような……あっ。\nケンカが始まって……。みんな落ち着いてください～。", "zh": "哎呀～？感觉样子好像有点奇怪……啊。\n开始吵架了……大家请冷静一下～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6300_p", "source_sha256": "40e672420741ba8b924b8599090ea4e7acb58653856eba21ebd14d2350f31653", "ja": "ほら、狐が化けるとき、頭に葉っぱを乗せるだろ？\n同じことをして、仲間だと思ってもらうとか……。", "zh": "你看，狐狸变身的时候，不是会在头上顶片叶子吗？我们也做同样的事，说不定就能让它把我们当成同伴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6301_031tom", "source_sha256": "a309da7ea2dde24d6096147e82d7c47a453f97ff9654d47154b0d0516ad95c10", "ja": "素敵なアイディアだと思いますが……\n葉っぱを乗せるだけでは足りないかもしれませんね～？", "zh": "我觉得这是个很棒的主意，不过……光是在头上放片叶子，可能还不够呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_6302_031tom", "source_sha256": "ac70b09044b86a144950fbfe2e39b1d09d211dc7862e51d2e67579b9dad28cfb", "ja": "ふふっ。こんなところに餌のお皿が……。まずは、\nお手本をお願いします、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "呵呵，这种地方居然有装饲料的盘子……首先，请您做个示范吧，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
